OTU.fna is a fasta file of all Archaea OTUs used in the paper
KSGP_v3.1_keep_phyloseq.Rdata contains an R Phyloseq object containing all the archael OTU, their abundances and annotations using KSGP Sintax v 3.1
KSGP_plus_v3.1_keep_phyloseq.Rdata contains an R Phyloseq object containing all the archaeal OTU, their abundances and annotations using KSGP+ v 3.1
515_OTU.fna is a fasta file of the bacterial OTUs used in the paper
